  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot into half moons.\n• Cut zucchini into small chunks.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• Drain and rinse konjac noodles.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541b14f1cefd62c18e5a059-6dc2d880.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the boiling water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people), peanut butter, soy sauce and hoisin sauce, until well combined. TIP: Cook tofu in batches for the best results.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541b14f1cefd62c18e5a059-791bf087.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out saucepan and return to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and zucchini, tossing, until slightly tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-high, and stir in hoisin mixture. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir through konjac noodles, cooked tofu and baby spinach leaves, until warmed through and wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541b14f1cefd62c18e5a059-0a64f94b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide hoisin peanut tofu and konjac noodle stir fry between bowls.\n• Top with chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541b14f1cefd62c18e5a059-485520d7.jpeg"
    }
  ]
